{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1105, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1adf1d7816081b82f2ff8b2f17cf17df2bd81432f2ff18efa63f169f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "우와～∈//이 관람차，//정말 크다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うわ～！//この観覧車、//スッゴク大きいね！", "pointer_offset": 940, "unit": "dialogue:adcbcdf78423c44e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1148, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f24cf24df0b68143f283f0b2f1edf194f195f0f12f2ff1c3f1c8f9c9f1acf0b2f957f283f0b2f14ff168f1442f2ff198fc97f154f0f08144", "baseline_text": "확실히，놀이공원답게//즐거워 보이는 놀이기구가//잔뜩 있네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "たしかに、遊園地だけあって、//楽しそうな乗り物が//いっぱいあるね。", "pointer_offset": 944, "unit": "dialogue:16336f30527e9e41", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1215, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d12f2ff0b5f3eefa82f16ff0b22f2ff8b2f17cf17df2bdf8b9f183f984f2bff15a81b8", "baseline_text": "있잖아，아이리스…//오빠랑 같이//이 관람차에 타고 싶어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねえ、アイリス……//お兄ちゃんといっしょに//この観覧車にのりたい∈", "pointer_offset": 948, "unit": "dialogue:ea0273eaf1c661d9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1282, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2b381ac2f2ff0af8143f0aff0b2f0aef0aaf7d12f2ff1f7fad6f140f0d3f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "으앗〓//아，아이리스…//전투 중인데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いいっ〓//ア、アイリス……//戦闘中なんだけど……", "pointer_offset": 952, "unit": "dialogue:4787ddc756290973", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1331, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f273f274f0a481b82f2ff154f276f0af816081b8", "baseline_text": "있잖아，괜찮지∈//있잖아～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねえ、いいでしょ∈//ね～え～！", "pointer_offset": 956, "unit": "dialogue:963017cf1d73a0ff", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1362, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f0d88143f0d8f27ef0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "그，그렇네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そ、そうだな……", "pointer_offset": 960, "unit": "dialogue:017e2b90c088057d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1379, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f183f366f26181b8", "baseline_text": "좋아，타볼까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、乗ろうか！", "pointer_offset": 964, "unit": "dialogue:b9338acb1f302101", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1396, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f1f7fad6f140f0b2f0b8fa61f991f2678144", "baseline_text": "전투 중이니까 안 돼．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "戦闘中だからダメだよ。", "pointer_offset": 968, "unit": "dialogue:03b23df645d0ab30", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1419, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f173f0dbf8e1f364f8b2f1cff0af8144", "baseline_text": "귀신의 집이 좋아．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "オバケ屋敷がいいな。", "pointer_offset": 972, "unit": "dialogue:ced22b1f1fe8aba3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1440, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f183f366f26181b82f2ff0a6fa4df0b1f0f481432f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aaf9d7f183f984f2bff1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "좋아，타볼까∈//사실 나도，//아이리스와 타고 싶었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よし、乗ろうか！//実は俺も、//アイリスと乗りたかったんだ。", "pointer_offset": 976, "unit": "dialogue:a80c70bca9ca2e59", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1499, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f18efa63f18efa63f18ef26381ac2f2ff14bf39af0cf81b82f2ff0b5f3ee8143f25af96bf1cff0af815c81b8", "baseline_text": "정말 정말 정말〓//해냈다∈//오빠，너무 좋아―∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ホントにホントにホント〓//やったぁ！//お兄ちゃん、大すきー∈", "pointer_offset": 980, "unit": "dialogue:81f56f84cd134443", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1560, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af8143f0d8f2ca2f2ff0ecf0b9f8f1f1daf167f8a4f287f0f4f3842f2ff177f16bf0b9f947f19cf0aef957f1c8f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "좋아，그럼//적에게 들키지 않도록//광무에서 내리는 거야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よーし、じゃあ//敵に気付かれないように//光武を降りるんだよ……", "pointer_offset": 984, "unit": "dialogue:8925196830b8bcc8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1623, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f2c9f2e9f15af7d12f2ff1998160f19af8bcf263f0b2f14881442f2ff1998160f19af0bcf7d1", "baseline_text": "응，알았어…//살～며시 말이야．//살～며시…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、わかった……//そ～っとだね。//そ～っと……", "pointer_offset": 988, "unit": "dialogue:c66c06af81783648", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 3012, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0b2f3498143f0b5f0b5f144f0ab81b82f2ff8f0f1d6f0a18143f16bfa89f1abf9acf16ff8f3f190f0c82f2ff0a5f984f154f957f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "이봐，오오가미∈//네 녀석，무슨 바보 같은 짓을//하고 있는 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こらっ！　大神っ∈//てめぇ、なにバカなこと//やってんだ！", "pointer_offset": 992, "unit": "dialogue:39a93598f415ffdf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 3071, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2b381b82f2ff0ef8143f0eff0f0f8cff0a6f240f17cf27a81ac", "baseline_text": "으앗∈//요，요네다 사령관님〓", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いいっ！//よ、米田司令〓", "pointer_offset": 996, "unit": "dialogue:e3fac140077223db", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 3100, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f18ef263f0b2f0a48143f8f0f1d6f0a1f0f3f7d12f2ff174f0aef261f8a4f144f947f158f957f299f1d42f2ff35ff9c9fa60f1c8f29c81b8", "baseline_text": "정말이지，네 녀석은…//파리까지 가서 노는 것만//배워 온 거냐∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "まったく、てめぇは……//巴里まで行って遊ぶことしか//勉強してきてねぇのか！", "pointer_offset": 1000, "unit": "dialogue:c357d5973ad5ac6e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 3183, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff383f0b8f0cf81b82f2ff0d8fa62fa8af0aff383f0b8f0cf81b82f2ff3ddf0a2f0a3f957f1e2f0e1f0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "아，아닙니다∈//그런 건 아닙니다∈//앞으로는 주의하겠습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "い、いえ！//そんなことはありません∈//以後、気をつけます！", "pointer_offset": 1004, "unit": "dialogue:3585bf662c568aaf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1888, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0abf191f14b8143f0b5f3ee81442f2ff0aff0b2f0aef8aaf16ef146f0b981432f2ff254f8b1f26cf35df0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "…미안해，오빠．//아이리스 때문에，//혼나 버렸네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……ごめんね、お兄ちゃん。//アイリスのせいで、//おこられちゃったね……", "pointer_offset": 1008, "unit": "dialogue:23c45f4b5f8ec760", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 1959, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0dbf9c2f2e4f8a4f287f0aff8f4f26781442f2ff17cf17df2bdf957f0cff2c3f0b92f2ff283f8c7f14cf8c8f96ef183f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "신경 쓰지 않아도 돼．//관람차는 다음에//놀러 왔을 때 타자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "気にしなくていいよ。//観覧車は、また今度、//遊びに来たときにしようね。", "pointer_offset": 1012, "unit": "dialogue:2dd836c43158ff70", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2030, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f2c9f2e9f15a81b82f2ff2d8f15cf0b2f1488143f0b5f3ee81b8", "baseline_text": "응，알았어∈//약속이야，오빠∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、わかった！//約束だよ、お兄ちゃん∈", "pointer_offset": 1016, "unit": "dialogue:a004323bdf145d98", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2071, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f1f7fad6f140f0b2f0b8fa61f991f26781442f2ff0cff2c3f8b9f0a5f0fa8144", "baseline_text": "전투 중이니까 안 돼．//다음에 하자．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "戦闘中だからダメだよ。//また今度にしようね。", "pointer_offset": 1020, "unit": "dialogue:136bb68ca4c79a11", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2116, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f36cf36cf14bf7d12f2ff0b5f3ee81432f2ff25af96bf151f0a4f0a5f0cff0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "심심해…//오빠，//너무 진지하다니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "つまんないの……//お兄ちゃん、//マジメすぎだよ。", "pointer_offset": 1024, "unit": "dialogue:5b7f663f3bc1d9ce", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 3244, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff0b8f7d12f2ff1ccf965f0b1f8f4f0e2f0e4f0b2f0b8f261f7d12f2ff0ecf8c8f2e4f0c7f557fa7cf16ef261f0a4f157f7d1f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "아，아니…//일단 나도 대장이니까…//적을 쓰러뜨릴 때까지는…말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "い、いや……//一応、俺も隊長だし……//敵を倒すまでは……ね。", "pointer_offset": 1028, "unit": "dialogue:fd8ad67c0e85ab36", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2226, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0f0f0f08143f2c9f2e9f15af0ef81b82f2ff0af8160f0aff7d12f2ff17cf17dfabdf183f984f2bff1f3f157f18d81608144", "baseline_text": "네네，알았어요∈//아～아…//관람차 타고 싶었는데～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はいはい、りょーかいしました！//あ～ぁ……//観覧車、のりたかったな～。", "pointer_offset": 1032, "unit": "dialogue:4f5ce10b8718133d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2297, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f2b5f244f244f7d12f2ff0b2f14bf94bf265f7d1", "baseline_text": "토호호…//이해해 줘…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "トホホ……//わかってくれよ……", "pointer_offset": 1036, "unit": "dialogue:6181272a26e10b2f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2328, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2c3f7d12f2ff0b2f463f0b2f1c78143f173f0dbf8e1f364f0b22f2ff1cff8c8fa99f16ff0f3f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "으음…//이왕이면，귀신의 집이//좋을 것 같은데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "う～ん……//どうせなら、オバケ屋敷が//いいと思うけど……", "pointer_offset": 1040, "unit": "dialogue:9709ac72f5cf2f4b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2385, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "f15af7d12f2ff1738143f173f0db8148", "baseline_text": "어…//귀，귀신？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え……//オ、オバケ？", "pointer_offset": 1044, "unit": "dialogue:245b70bdbcd4a522", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2406, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f1bef8c7f173f0dbf0b281432f2f8175f194f34ff0a5f0cf81608176f0a5f1c7f1472f2ff0b1f0b5f957f1c8f1488144", "baseline_text": "여러 귀신이，//「원통하다～」하면서//나오는 거야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いろんなオバケが、//「うらめしや～」って、//出てくるんだよ。", "pointer_offset": 1048, "unit": "dialogue:4eb393588ce49ef5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2467, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f15a8143f3f2f15af7d1", "baseline_text": "어，싫어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え、ヤダ……", "pointer_offset": 1052, "unit": "dialogue:7cff31156d0d15ea", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2480, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f16bf559f0a48160f7d12f2ff451f8b9f29ff8f4fa81f280f2e18144", "baseline_text": "무섭지～…//밤에 잠도 못 잘걸．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "怖いぞぅ……//夜、眠れなくなっちゃうぞ。", "pointer_offset": 1056, "unit": "dialogue:f129ae097fcb1c30", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2521, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f55ef0aff0aff0aff34e81b82f2ff0af8143f0aff0b2f0aef8aaf0b2f8dff25df15a81b82f2ff34ff8dbf2d0f56e817c81b8", "baseline_text": "꺄아아아악∈//아，아이리스 이제 됐어∈//통신 종료－∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "キャァァァァッ！//ア、アイリスもういい∈//つーしんしゅうりょーっ！", "pointer_offset": 1060, "unit": "dialogue:b79d1750954ec0ad", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2588, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a5f0a58143f3b5f39bf0b2f148f7d12f2ff15af0a881482f2ff0aff0b2f0aef0aa8148", "baseline_text": "하하하，농담이야…//어라？//아이리스？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ははは、冗談だよ……//って、あれ？//アイリス？", "pointer_offset": 1064, "unit": "dialogue:86a1517cb967a08d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2635, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f2acf0bc2f2ff25af96bf283f0a8f8f1f0ccf0b18148", "baseline_text": "혹시//너무 놀라게 했나？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ひょっとして//おどかしすぎたかな？", "pointer_offset": 1068, "unit": "dialogue:088ba682e41f9da5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0034", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2670, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "8163816381638163", "baseline_text": "…………", "kind": "ascr", "source": "…………", "pointer_offset": 1072, "unit": "dialogue:b5999fb8c439aedc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0035", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2679, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f253f14ff7d1f0b5f3ee81482f2ff2acf0bc81432f2ff163f9aef1c8f1488148", "baseline_text": "저기…오빠？//혹시，//화난 거야？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あの……お兄ちゃん？//ひょっとして、//おこっちゃった？", "pointer_offset": 1076, "unit": "dialogue:9c40e4bac80406fb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0036", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2734, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f163f9aefa8af0aff0b8f0a4f1d481432f2ff25af96bf0dff46ef0e2f8a3f28ef1c72f2ff2f5f0b4f14bf7d1", "baseline_text": "아니，화난 건 아니지만，//너무 제멋대로 굴면//곤란해…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、怒ってはないけど、//あまりワガママを言われると//困るよ……", "pointer_offset": 1080, "unit": "dialogue:a9f4b9bea69778d5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0037", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2799, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f0aff0b8f1c8f2c081442f2ff0a5f0a4f1d4f7d1f0b5f3eef0e72f2ff2f5f0b4f0a5f8f1f1d4fac0fa99f16ff0f08144", "baseline_text": "아，아니거든．//하지만…오빠를//곤란하게 만든 것 같네．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ち、ちがうもん。//でも……お兄ちゃんを//こまらせちゃったみたいだね。", "pointer_offset": 1084, "unit": "dialogue:51fef07a8c039005", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0038", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2868, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0a4f17bf8f3f1f7fad6f140f0b2f0b8f261f7d12f2ff394f395f947f0abf191f14b8144", "baseline_text": "지금은 전투 중이니까…//떼써서 미안해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いまはせんとう中だもんね……//ワガママいって//ごめんなさい。", "pointer_offset": 1088, "unit": "dialogue:40d2be78a37c2282", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0039", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2929, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f2c9f0aff3ebf0a2f9c7f25df15a81442f2ff0fa8143f484f19cf0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "아니，알아줬으면 됐어．//자，힘내자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや、わかってくれれば//いいんだよ。//さあ、がんばろう！", "pointer_offset": 1092, "unit": "dialogue:04f05fefcc7ef0c4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN#0040", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02013.SBN", "offset": 2986, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f3a88143f2c9f2e9f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "응，알았어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん、りょーかいっ！", "pointer_offset": 1096, "unit": "dialogue:92e34e5503f57423", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
